    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, that's strange. I'm looking at the preliminary patient intake notes from the site in Chicago and there's a small cluster of reports regarding severe dizziness and vertigo in the last 24 hours. It doesn't look massive, but it's definitely a deviation from the baseline. \n\nAre you not seeing those in the telemetry feed, or is there a delay in how those specific adverse event symptoms are being categorized in your summary?",
